        "id": 0,
        "original_id": "f644ba71-f27b-5061-a680-70fa02d27fbb",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Frank Darabont, Stephen King, IronE Singleton, Andrew Lincoln, Norman Reedus, Steven Yeun\n- Works: The Shawshank Redemption, The Green Mile, The Mist, The Walking Dead, Vatos\n- Characters: T-Dog, Rick Grimes, Daryl Dixon, Glenn Rhee, Merle\n- Roles: director, writer, series developer, actor\n\nFacts:\n- Frank Darabont is known as a director for film adaptations of Stephen King works including The Shawshank Redemption, The Green Mile, and The Mist.\n- Frank Darabont wrote and directed the film The Mist.\n- Frank Darabont created the character T-Dog for The Walking Dead, and IronE Singleton portrayed T-Dog.\n- In the The Walking Dead episode Vatos, Rick Grimes is played by Andrew Lincoln, Daryl Dixon is played by Norman Reedus, T-Dog is played by IronE Singleton, and Glenn Rhee is played by Steven Yeun.\n- In Vatos, Rick Grimes, Daryl Dixon, T-Dog, and Glenn Rhee return to downtown Atlanta to search for Daryl Dixon's brother, Merle.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
